  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "Désolé de ne pas te regarder\npendant que je te parle...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 172,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004400E90073006F006C00E90020006400650020006E00650020007000610073002000740065002000720065006700610072006400650072000A00700065006E00640061006E007400200071007500650020006A00650020007400650020007000610072006C0065002E002E002E00100002011401BA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 60
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mais j’ai affreusement mal au dos.\nUn bon gros lumbago des familles !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 292,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D0061006900730020006A201900610069002000610066006600720065007500730065006D0065006E00740020006D0061006C00200061007500200064006F0073002E000A0055006E00200062006F006E002000670072006F00730020006C0075006D006200610067006F0020006400650073002000660061006D0069006C006C006500730020002100100002011401BA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 74
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’ai tellement mal que je ne peux pas bouger...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nJe n’ose même pas crier pour demander de l’aide\ntant la douleur est intense...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 440,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 134
    },
    {
      "displayText": "La dernière fois, c’est un Pokémon\nqui m’a soulagé !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 708,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C00610020006400650072006E006900E80072006500200066006F00690073002C00200063201900650073007400200075006E00200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E000A0071007500690020006D2019006100200073006F0075006C0061006700E90020002100100002011401BA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 57
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Il a utilisé une capacité...\nJe crois que c’était... <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>Octoprise<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000> ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 77
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pourrais-je te demander un service ?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nJ’aimerais que tu m’amènes un Pokémon capable\nde lancer Octoprise sur moi.<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nJe sais que les <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>Krakos<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000> peuvent l’apprendre.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 12,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 980,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 174
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Fais vite...\nTu es... mon dernier espoir.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1328,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004600610069007300200076006900740065002E002E002E000A00540075002000650073002E002E002E0020006D006F006E0020006400650072006E0069006500720020006500730070006F00690072002E00100002011401BA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1420,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je t’en supplie... Aurais-tu un <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>Krakos<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000> pouvant\nutiliser <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>Octoprise<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000> sur moi... ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 14,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1432,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 99
    },
    {
      "displayText": "OOOH !!!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1632,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F004F004F0048002000210021002100100002011401BA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "MON DOS A FAIT CRAC !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1660,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D004F004E00200044004F00530020004100200046004100490054002000430052004100430020002100100002011401BA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mon dos me fait moins mal...\nCe massage était super efficace !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1712,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D006F006E00200064006F00730020006D0065002000660061006900740020006D006F0069006E00730020006D0061006C002E002E002E000A004300650020006D006100730073006100670065002000E900740061006900740020007300750070006500720020006500660066006900630061006300650020002100100002011401BA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 67
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ton Pokémon s’est concentré sur la source\nde mes douleurs, c’est remarquable.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1848,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    },
    {
      "displayText": "En tout cas, grâce à Octoprise, me voilà bel et\nbien soulagé !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045006E00200074006F007500740020006300610073002C00200067007200E200630065002000E00020004F00630074006F00700072006900730065002C0020006D006500200076006F0069006C00E0002000620065006C002000650074000A006200690065006E00200073006F0075006C0061006700E90020002100100002011401BA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 67
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je te dois une fière chandelle !\nTu es vraiment admirable.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2148,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A006500200074006500200064006F0069007300200075006E006500200066006900E8007200650020006300680061006E00640065006C006C006500200021000A0054007500200065007300200076007200610069006D0065006E0074002000610064006D0069007200610062006C0065002E00100002011401BA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 63
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Même si j’ai bien cru à un moment donné que\nton Pokémon allait me casser en deux...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2276,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 88
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Merci à toi aussi, Krakos !\nTu es l’as du craquement d’os !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D0065007200630069002000E000200074006F0069002000610075007300730069002C0020004B00720061006B006F007300200021000A005400750020006500730020006C2019006100730020006400750020006300720061007100750065006D0065006E0074002000642019006F00730020002100100002011401BA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 64
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je m’attendais à un Krakos, mais tu as été tout\naussi efficace, Sepiatroce !<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nMerci à toi aussi, ce n’était pas si... atroce...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2580,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 134
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tu sais, c’est terrible, les lumbagos.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2848,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0054007500200073006100690073002C0020006320190065007300740020007400650072007200690062006C0065002C0020006C006500730020006C0075006D006200610067006F0073002E00100002011401BA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "La douleur survient toujours sans crier gare, et\nune fois qu’elle est là, on ne peut plus rien faire !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2936,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 107
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Alors, fais-moi plaisir : profite de ta vie\n— et de ta souplesse — afin de n’avoir<U+0010><U+0001>븀\naucun regret lorsque ton dos te fera défaut !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 3152,
